	["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20. Skin {npc:2033}, Nightsaber and {npc:2043} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349 {item:2318} pro {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} a {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: zvířata levelu 5–20. Stahuj {npc:2033}, Nightsaber a {npc:2043} tady (level 5–20); trasu vede návod na {skill:393}.",
